# Product reports location

When generating product reviews, E2E validation reports, checklists, or screenshot galleries for MediBrick:

**Primary output (always write here):**

`/Users/gagandeep/Desktop/cursor/reports/`

Use subfolders per review run:

`/Users/gagandeep/Desktop/cursor/reports/YYYY-MM-DD_HHmmss_<review-type>/`

After each run, update at the **top** of the reports folder (sorts first by name):

- `00-LATEST.md` — index pointing to the newest run
- `01-latest/` — symlink to the newest run (open this anytime for the current report)

Older timestamped folders remain below for history.

Include:
- Markdown summary (`*-review.md`)
- JSON machine report when applicable (`*-report.json`)
- Screenshots under `screenshots/` inside the same subfolder

**Optional mirror in repo:** `docs/*-review/` only if the user asks for in-repo copies.

**Scripts:** Use `scripts/product-review/cursor-reports-path.mjs` for the default path. Override with `--out=<dir>`.

Do not commit Cursor-folder reports unless the user explicitly requests it.
